(MUHYISSUNNAH DARS UKKUDA - HADITH STUDIES MODULE) '
(==================================================) '
(Subject: Hadith Methodology & Commentary) '
(Source: Sahih Al-Bukhari \(Kitab Al-Iman\)) '
() '
(HADITH 1: NARRATION OF FAITH & ACTIONS) '
(---------------------------------------) '
(Narrated by Amir al-Mu'minin Umar ibn al-Khattab \(R.A.\):) '
("Actions are judged by intentions, and every person will get what they intended...") '
() '
(KEY LESSONS:) '
(1. Pure Intention \(Ikhlas\) is the foundation of all righteous deeds.) '
(2. Migration \(Hijrah\) for Allah & His Messenger yields spiritual reward.) '
(3. Worldly gains or status seeking invalidates sacred reward.) '
() '
(Faculty Guidance: Memorize narrator chain \(Sanad\) and key vocabulary.) '
(Muhyissunnah Dars Ukkuda Hadith Department.) '
